    if($slug==='privacy'&&blog_language()!=='ar')$main='<div class="wrap"><article class="legal-page"><p class="eyebrow">Your privacy</p><h1>Privacy, plainly.</h1><h2>Cookies and your choice</h2><p>This blog stores an essential cookie to remember your Accept or Reject choice for 180 days. Optional analytics and advertising cookies are not installed. YouTube players load only after Accept and an explicit Play action. Playing a video contacts YouTube, which processes information under its own privacy policy. Reject disables players. Watch on YouTube links remain available. You can change your choice with Cookie preferences in the footer.</p><h2>Admin access</h2><p>The private dashboard uses an essential session cookie for sign-in and protected forms. It is HttpOnly, restricted to the admin area, and secure on HTTPS. Sessions expire after inactivity.</p><h2>Contact messages</h2><p>If you use Contact, your name, email, and message are stored in this website’s database so Ahmad can read and respond. They are accessible only through the authenticated dashboard. You may request deletion using Contact.</p><h2>Newsletter</h2><p>Signing up stores your email, opt-in time, subscription status, and an unsubscribe token. You must explicitly choose to receive updates. Ahmad can export subscribers for an email provider; no campaign service is connected by this package. Every update must include the person’s unsubscribe link. You can request deletion through Contact.</p><h2>Hosting</h2><p>Hostinger hosts this website and its database after installation. Hosting may retain standard server logs. Abuse protection temporarily stores keyed hashes derived from IP addresses for up to 24 hours. No analytics scripts are installed. External links follow their own privacy policies.</p></article></div>';
